4. **Metrics**: Track local-cache hits, global-pool fetches, CAS retry rate, and allocation/free latency percentiles

## Why This Is Asked

Tests hands-on understanding of memory hierarchy, NUMA locality, and practical optimization trade-offs in a real kernel.

## Key Concepts

- Cache tiling for L1/L2 reuse
- NUMA first-touch locality on multi-socket systems
